.TH GRID_MAX_SCROLL 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
grid_max_scroll \- The largest scroll value that still fills the window: total rows minus visible rows, never below 0
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqgrid.h\(dq
.BI "int grid_max_scroll(const Grid *g);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The largest scroll value that still fills the window: total rows minus visible rows, never below 0. scroll is kept within 0..this.
